'''Kitaro Cat & Nezumi-Otoko Cat''' was an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] exclusive to the GeGeGe no Kitarou Collaboration Event, only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]]. It is a variant of [[Baby Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Baby Cat]].

